                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="-The vehicle must be returned in the same condition as it was released, excluding normal wear and tear.&#xa;-The Lessee is responsible for any loss or damage to the vehicle during the rental period&#xa;-If the vehicle is operated by someone not listed as an authorized driver, the Lessee assumes full liability for all damages and losses.&#xa;-Any damage, theft, or accident must be reported to the Company immediately.&#xa;-A police report must be filed within 24 hours of the incident.&#xa;-If the driver is provided by the Company and acting within their assigned duty, the Company will accept full responsibility for any damage caused.&#xa;"/>
